{
  "name": "dsh-video-insight",
  "version": "0.4.8",
  "description": "在 DeepSeek Harness 里快速分析视频：左侧栏「视频解析」面板，粘贴 YouTube / 哔哩哔哩链接，自动抓字幕并生成总结、章节、要点、原文与追问；无字幕时可用本机 Whisper / SenseVoice 转写兜底（音频不出本机），纯无声视频还能用画面文字识别（OCR）或视觉模型描述画面；右栏有 AI 思维导图；追问是基于转写稿的 RAG 问答（回答带「依据」时间戳）；分析结果按视频缓存，历史记录可回看。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Jerry (Azerz)",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Azerz/dsh-video.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Azerz/dsh-video#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Azerz/dsh-video/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh",
    "video",
    "youtube",
    "bilibili",
    "bilibili-subtitle",
    "transcript",
    "whisper",
    "asr",
    "ocr",
    "mindmap",
    "rag",
    "summary",
    "bibiGPT"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/*.js",
    "client/*.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
